*HEADING
Open-ended thick cylinder (inner radius a = 10, outer b = 20, a slice of height 2) under
internal pressure p = 1, applied as a radial surface traction (*DSLOAD TRVEC) on the
inner face; CAX8, E = 1000, nu = 0.3. Lame (axial stress 0): u_r(r) = p a^2 / (E (b^2 -
a^2)) ((1 - nu) r + (1 + nu) b^2 / r), so u_r(a) = 0.019667 and u_r(b) = 0.013333.
** node (i, j) = 1 + i + 100 j: i = 0..20 from r = a to r = b, j = 0..2 up the slice
*NODE
1, 10., 0.
21, 20., 0.
201, 10., 2.
221, 20., 2.
